  "agent": "Vogt Realty Group",
  "text": "Classic Roslindale Colonial full of charm and character! The welcoming covered front porch leads into a spacious front entryway, featuring high ceilings, hardwood floors, and beautiful period details throughout the home. The sun-filled living room flows into the formal dining room with an original fireplace and built-in hutch. The updated kitchen offers ample cabinetry, stainless steel appliances, and a glass slider leading to a spacious composite deck overlooking the large fenced-in backyard. Perfect for entertaining, gardening or relaxing in your own private outdoor space. A convenient half bath completes the first floor. Upstairs, you'll find three generously sized bedrooms and an updated full bathroom. The walk up third floor offers a finished bonus room (unheated), perfect for a home office, playroom or flex space, plus an additional unfinished room for storage. Conveniently located near Roslindale Village, local restaurants, shops, the Commuter Rail, Forest Hills and the Arnold Arboretum.",
