  "agent": "Engel & Volkers South Boston",
  "text": "Full of character and rich in charm, 25 Percival Street is a truly special Dorchester single-family residence offering just under 4,000 square feet of living space, 5 bedrooms, 2 full bathrooms, and 1 garage parking space. The original architectural details, timeless craftsmanship, and beautiful woodwork, this home captures the character of a bygone era while offering an abundance of space and versatility for modern living. Filled with natural sunlight, the home features generously sized living areas, a stunning arched picture window in the living room, and two fireplaces that add warmth and character throughout. Recent updates include improvements to the kitchen, roof, and bathrooms, new laundry, a new refrigerator, fresh interior and exterior paint, all-new windows throughout, and beautifully sanded and refinished hardwood floors. With its impressive size, historic details, and unique charm, homes like 25 Percival Street are seldom found in Dorchester, making this a distinctive opportunity to own a truly special piece of the neighborhood.",
