  "agent": "Bantry Way Brokerage Llc",
  "text": "Welcome to 35 Caspar Street, a charming single-family home that blends classic character with everyday comfort. Built in 1925 and thoughtfully maintained, this move-in-ready residence offers 862 square feet of living space, making it an excellent opportunity for first-time homebuyers, downsizers, or anyone seeking an alternative to condominium living.Inside, you'll find two comfortable bedrooms, a full bathroom, and a functional layout designed to maximize both space and flexibility. Beautiful hardwood floors and abundant natural light create a warm and inviting atmosphere throughout the home.Set on a generous 5,099-square-foot lot, the property offers rare outdoor space and privacy. The fully fenced backyard provides plenty of room for entertaining, gardening, pets, or simply enjoying your own private retreat. Unlike many condominium options, this home gives you the freedom to customize and enhance the property over time while maintaining complete control of your living environment.Whether you're looking for a move-in-ready home or a property with future potential, 35 Caspar Street delivers a unique combination of character, privacy, and opportunity in a convenient Boston location.",
