  "text": "A rare opportunity to own a detached single-family home in East Boston! Welcome to 1 Marion Place, where classic Colonial charm meets the flexibility of modern living. Inside, discover a versatile layout featuring two spacious upstairs bedrooms, a flexible first-floor room ideal for additional sleeping space, a home office, or a cozy retreat, and a separate living area for relaxing or entertaining. The kitchen flows into the dining area, creating an inviting space for everyday meals and gatherings. A full bathroom on the main level adds convenience, while the unfinished basement offers dedicated laundry and storage space. Enjoy the freedom of single-family living with convenient access to East Boston's restaurants, shops, and public transportation. Whether you're looking for your first home or a space to make your own, 1 Marion Place offers an exciting opportunity to put down roots in East Boston. Schedule your private showing!",
